scenario: The bear comes too close, then backs off
id: arch3.bear-deterred
kind: nominal
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: The bear enters the safe perimeter: light and sound scare it off; it backs off and the drone tracks it again.
description: 3 - Centralized orchestrator. One moment of the mission; what leads there is in its preconditions.
author: MBSE Shepherd, Part 3
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 3
given: arch3.bear-enters

phase Predator response

  step too-close: pasture sends Predator entering safe perimiter
    note: Engage request: the orchestrator orders the deterrence.
    then soi.orch is Predator counteraction
    then soi.pm is Deterring
    then message Light burst
    then message Sound burst

  step backs-off: pasture sends Predator leaving safe perimiter
    note: Disengage request: back to tracking.
    then soi.orch is Predator tracking
    then soi.pm is Deterrence idle
